  "bot_setup_step1_title": "Step 1: Create bot in Telegram (via @BotFather)",
  "bot_setup_step1_intro": "No coding skills required. Telegram provides an official bot @BotFather that creates bots in 1 minute via simple text prompts:",
  "bot_setup_step1_1": "Open the official bot",
  "bot_setup_step1_1_end": "and press «Start».",
  "bot_setup_step1_2": "Send the command /newbot to @BotFather.",
  "bot_setup_step1_3_ask": "The bot will ask: «Alright, a new bot. How are we going to call it?».",
  "bot_setup_step1_3_action": "Write your salon name that clients will see (e.g., Downtown Barbershop or Top Gun Salon).",
  "bot_setup_step1_4_ask": "Next, the bot will ask for username: «Now let's choose a username for your bot. It must end in `bot`».",
  "bot_setup_step1_4_action": "Enter in English letters a unique username ending in bot (e.g., borodach_barber_bot or my_salon123_bot).",
  "bot_setup_step1_5_text": "In response, @BotFather will send a congratulations message containing:",
  "bot_setup_step1_5_sub": "Click on this long token to copy it to clipboard.",
  "bot_setup_step2_title": "Step 2: Paste token and username into control panel",
  "bot_setup_step2_intro": "So our system can send clients booking confirmations and reminders, save the received data:",
  "bot_setup_step2_1": "Open the section",
  "bot_setup_step2_1_end": "in the left sidebar menu.",
  "bot_setup_step2_2": "Scroll down to the «Salon Telegram Bot» section.",
  "bot_setup_step2_3": "In the «Bot HTTP API Token» field, paste the copied token from Step 1.5.",
  "bot_setup_step2_4": "In the «Bot Username in Telegram» field, enter the bot login without @ symbol (e.g., borodach_barber_bot).",
  "bot_setup_step2_5": "Click the green «Save Settings» button at the bottom of the page.",
  "bot_setup_step3_title": "Step 3: Enable «Online Booking» button in Telegram bot",
  "bot_setup_step3_intro": "Configure the Mini App button right in the bot menu so clients can open your schedule in one click:",
  "bot_setup_step3_1": "Copy your salon's personal link:",
  "bot_setup_step3_2": "Open @BotFather again and send the command /setmenubutton.",
  "bot_setup_step3_3": "@BotFather will show your bot list. Click on your bot's name (e.g., @your_bot).",
  "bot_setup_step3_4": "@BotFather will write: «Please send the URL of your Web App...». Paste and send the link you copied in step 3.1.",
