  "landing_faq_badge": "Knowledge Base & FAQ",
  "landing_faq_title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
  "landing_faq_sub": "Everything you need to know about online booking and ARCH SYSTEM capabilities",
  "landing_faq_q1": "How does online booking via Telegram Mini App work?",
  "landing_faq_a1": "The client follows a link or button in your Telegram channel/bot, taps «Book», and an interactive app opens right inside Telegram with service catalog, master selection, and available time slots in 30 seconds without external websites.",
  "landing_faq_q2": "Do I need a separate website or domain for my business?",
  "landing_faq_a2": "No, a separate website is not required. The entire ecosystem works completely inside the Telegram Mini App for clients and the convenient ARCH SYSTEM cloud web dashboard for owners and administrators.",
  "landing_faq_q3": "How do I connect my own Telegram bot to the platform?",
  "landing_faq_a3": "In the «Bot Setup» section, create a bot in @BotFather in 1 minute, paste the API token into the dashboard, and ARCH SYSTEM automatically sets up webhooks, welcome messages, and the Mini App launch button.",
  "landing_faq_q4": "How much is the subscription and how does payment work?",
  "landing_faq_a4": "The price is 18 TON per month (or configured amount). Payment is made transparently and securely via TON cryptocurrency directly in the web dashboard or with an activation key.",
  "landing_faq_q5": "Is the service suitable for solo masters or large salons?",
  "landing_faq_a5": "Yes, ARCH SYSTEM is ideal for both solo professionals (barbers, stylists, nail artists, massage therapists) and large beauty studios and barbershops with dozens of staff and flexible shift schedules.",
  "landing_faq_q6": "Do clients and masters receive automatic reminders?",
  "landing_faq_a6": "Yes, the bot automatically sends reminders to clients about upcoming appointments and instantly notifies masters in Telegram of new bookings or cancellations.",
